  "description": "Stocks appear to be making moves, in the RIGHT direction! 🆙",
  "body_html": "<p>The short video has all the key updates. One quick note, <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-to-buy-mondaypossibly?r=4z8lgl\">a recession resistant stock I have been monitoring</a>, met my requirements this morning and the stop limit buy order was filled. Check that out if you didn’t see the original article. This stock was also in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813?target_reply_id=ef7f66c5-26c6-4197-9847-a521b6eae662&amp;showTarget=true\">Quick Notes</a> about how I was approaching it.</p><p>Primary point of the video:</p><ul><li><p>Stocks are moving the right direction, but no confirmation yet. Unsure if it is a bull trap or a local trend reversal. </p><ul><li><p>Price above ~$6857, the local down trend is broken. </p></li><li><p>Price above ~$6953, indicates broader market wants to trend higher</p></li></ul></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"911\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:911,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:659645,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/178506766?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EP-_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe87597b1-9875-4925-b95d-d2deaeb40cb3_2706x1694.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Let price action tell you that assets, as a whole, do in fact want to trend higher. This reduces the chances of fake outs and bull traps. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Palantir, is pretty much in the same boat, with gaps to both the upside and down side. Pure speculation here…I would not shock me to see it consolidate between those two price ranges, as investors figure out whether the market as a whole (like mentioned above) wants to go higher or not. Personally, I would not consider PLTR until bulls proved it wants to go above ~$208, and held. Thats just me though.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KdHq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc1ee173c-fc71-4363-a1eb-f25c6e12488d_2682x1688.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KdHq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc1ee173c-fc71-4363-a1eb-f25c6e12488d_2682x1688.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KdHq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc1ee173c-fc71-4363-a1eb-f25c6e12488d_2682x1688.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KdHq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc1ee173c-fc71-4363-a1eb-f25c6e12488d_2682x1688.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KdHq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc1ee173c-fc71-4363-a1eb-f25c6e12488d_2682x1688.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KdHq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fp